<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-26T22:28:49.536Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:28:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Baghdad has moved troops to secure Kurdish borders after the top court authorized a military presence and the takeover of border posts and oil fields, while the prime minister pushes for greater central authority over the Kurdish region. The defense ministry ordered nationwide troop deployment and the closure of oil smuggling routes, and a drone strike destroyed a militant vehicle in Anbar province. Hezbollah fighters were transferred onto Popular Mobilization Forces payroll, and Germany arrested an Iraqi duo suspected of plotting synagogue attacks. An Iraqi court sentenced eight French nationals to life imprisonment for IS group membership, and UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxPcFBlZXpjNmxudmFiTnBwb3VTalZDY1JoR3FaYUpabkNycXJfS2x0aDR4Z2NLNEtyRVowTXVIN1BzR1NMZjhBaU9GUzc4RTBUYWZHTFh4NS03dGQxc2lxQnlBQmNkWnVrdFJKU2lwQjc4OUl5VTVYVHlFWGdPT3QtQUN6dFRnZnNXaDRyLTU4ZGt5cUVPeWhISTdUU0ZHTWNzZDktRTZFUFFBckJ2cGIxcWVwRG5mc2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crisisgroup.org/qna/asia-pacific/myanmar/world-court-finds-myanmar-committed-genocide-against-rohingya&quot;&gt;International Crisis Group&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOOG53Qi15UG5QYUZVaUlOTjF5UmtpWE1PY3RxUnFUSklkbTY1RWVjX09aNmMxcHRkdE9ZQy03aThTZVBhUnotWnd1aVdkNzVGUmd0VXkybERzTUxfa3c1VDhGSWtZX0VGa05HTGx2ZVEwT3lFNW1JM21uSkhUSXBYYTJPV2tJTkpwcU1fdkpoYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.g